---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import Schema from '../../components/Schema.astro';

const title = 'Revolutionary Oil-Filtration Technology - HouseTech Group News';
const description = 'HouseTech Group debuts CycloClean oil-filtration technology with 99.8% grease separation efficiency, three-stage filtration, and washable filters for OEM range hoods.';

const articleSchema = {
  headline: 'HouseTech Debuts CycloClean Oil-Filtration Technology with 99.8% Efficiency',
  description: 'CycloClean achieves 99.8% grease separation via three-stage filtration, with washable filters lasting 5+ years across 60-120cm OEM range hood form factors.',
  image: 'https://www.housetech-ch.com/logo-housetech.png',
  datePublished: '2024-10-15',
  author: { name: 'HouseTech Group' },
  publisher: {
    name: 'HouseTech Group',
    logo: { url: 'https://www.housetech-ch.com/logo-housetech.png' }
  }
};

const faqItems = [
  {
    question: 'What is the grease separation efficiency of CycloClean?',
    answer: 'CycloClean achieves 99.8% grease separation efficiency, 14-29 percentage points above industry average.'
  },
  {
    question: 'How many filtration stages does CycloClean have?',
    answer: 'CycloClean uses three stages: centrifugal, electrostatic, and activated carbon filtration.'
  },
  {
    question: 'Are CycloClean filters washable?',
    answer: 'Yes, CycloClean filters are fully washable and dishwasher-safe, eliminating disposable filter costs.'
  },
  {
    question: 'How does centrifugal pre-separation work?',
    answer: '3000rpm rotation removes 75% of large grease particles before they reach the main filter.'
  },
  {
    question: 'What is the benefit of electrostatic filtration?',
    answer: 'Charged plates capture 95% of micro-particles (0.3-1μm) invisible to the naked eye.'
  },
  {
    question: 'How long do washable filters last?',
    answer: 'With monthly cleaning, filters maintain 98% efficiency for 5+ years of daily use.'
  },
  {
    question: 'Can CycloClean be integrated into OEM products?',
    answer: 'Yes, CycloClean adapts to 60-120cm range hoods with customizable geometry and capacity.'
  }
];
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <Schema type="article" data={articleSchema} />
  <Schema type="faq" data={{ items: faqItems }} />
  <Header activeNav="news" />
  
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <nav class="breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/news">News</a> / <span>Technology</span>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container">
      <article class="content-area" style="max-width: 850px;">
        
        <header class="article-header">
          <span class="article-category">Technology</span>
          <h1 class="article-title">Revolutionary Oil-Filtration Technology Debuts in Latest Range Hood Models</h1>
          <div class="article-meta-info">
            <span>📅 October 2024</span>
            <span>🏷️ Technology</span>
            <span>⏱️ 6 min read</span>
          </div>
        </header>

        <figure class="article-image-figure">
          <div style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/9;background:linear-gradient(135deg, #7c3aed, #5b21b6);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:var(--radius-lg);">
            <svg width="120" height="120" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.3)" stroke-width="1">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/>
              <path d="M12 1v4M12 19v4M4.22 4.22l2.83 2.83M16.95 16.95l2.83 2.83M1 12h4M19 12h4M4.22 19.78l2.83-2.83M16.95 7.05l2.83-2.83"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <figcaption class="article-image-caption">HouseTech's advanced oil-filtration technology</figcaption>
        </figure>

        <div class="article-body">
          <p>HouseTech CycloClean oil-filtration system achieves 99.8% grease separation efficiency, exceeding industry average of 70-85% by 14.8-29.8 percentage points. Three-stage architecture combines centrifugal, electrostatic, and activated carbon filtration designed for OEM integration.</p>
          
          <p>Traditional aluminum mesh filters capture only 70-85% of grease, leaving 15-30% of particles to enter exhaust ducts. Over 12 months of daily use, residue accumulates to 2-3kg per duct, increasing fire risk by 60% and reducing airflow by 35%.</p>
          
          <h2>Three-Stage Filtration Architecture</h2>
          
          <p>First centrifugal pre-separation stage removes 75% of large grease particles (≥10μm) through 3000rpm high-speed rotation. Particles forced to outer walls by centrifugal force flow into collection reservoir via gravity, extending main filter lifespan by 3x.</p>
          
          <p>Second electrostatic filtration stage captures 95% of remaining micro-particles (0.3-1μm) using charged metal plates. 8kV electric field ionizes passing particles attracted to oppositely charged collection plates, achieving 98% efficiency with 0.5μm diameter particles.</p>
          
          <p>Third activated carbon stage eliminates 90% of cooking odors and volatile organic compounds. 200g activated carbon bed with 240m²/g surface area provides 48,000m² total adsorption area for recirculating model indoor air quality compliance.</p>
          
          <h2>Washable Design & Maintenance</h2>
          
          <p>CycloClean filters are fully washable and dishwasher-safe, eliminating disposable filter costs averaging $50-80 per year. After 500 wash cycles, filtration efficiency drops by only 1.2%, maintaining 98.6% performance over 5+ years of monthly cleaning.</p>
          
          <p>500ml grease reservoir requires emptying every 2-3 months under typical daily cooking (2 hours/day). LED indicator alerts users when reservoir reaches 80% capacity. Commercial kitchen models feature built-in pump for direct external drainage.</p>
          
          <h2>OEM Integration & Customization</h2>
          
          <p>CycloClean technology integrates into range hoods with widths from 60-120cm, supporting airflow rates of 400-1200m³/h. Customization options include filter geometry (6 standard shapes), reservoir capacity (300-1000ml), and smart home connectivity for filter status alerts.</p>
          
          <p>Integration time for new OEM designs averages 45-60 days with dedicated engineering support. HouseTech provides complete validation documentation and regulatory compliance assistance for global market entry strategies.</p>
          
          <p>CycloClean delivers 99.8% grease separation via three-stage filtration, with washable filters lasting 5+ years for OEM integration across 60-120cm form factors.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-primary), #1a4a7a);border-radius:var(--radius-lg);padding:var(--spacing-xl);margin:var(--spacing-xl) 0;text-align:center;color:white;">
          <h3 style="font-size:var(--font-size-xl);margin-bottom:var(--spacing-sm);color:white;">Integrate CycloClean into Your Product Line</h3>
          <p style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);margin-bottom:var(--spacing-lg);max-width:600px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;">License our proprietary 3-stage filtration technology. Custom filter geometry, collection capacity, and smart home integration available.</p>
          <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:var(--spacing-sm);justify-content:center;">
            <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary" style="text-decoration:none;">Get OEM Quote →</a>
            <a href="/download" class="btn btn-outline-white" style="text-decoration:none;">Download Catalog</a>
            <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-outline-white" style="text-decoration:none;">Request Sample</a>
          </div>
        </div>
<nav class="article-nav">
          <a href="/news/southeast-asia-market-expansion" class="article-nav-link">
            <span class="article-nav-label">← Previous</span>
            <span class="article-nav-title">Southeast Asian Expansion</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/news/carbon-neutral-manufacturing" class="article-nav-link" style="margin-left:auto;text-align:right;">
            <span class="article-nav-label">Next →</span>
            <span class="article-nav-title">Carbon Neutral Manufacturing</span>
          </a>
        </nav>

        <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:var(--spacing-xl);">
          <a href="/news" class="btn btn-accent-outline">← Back to All News</a>
        </div>

      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
